activate DB
DB -->> P : 7. Document list
deactivate DB
P -->> S : 8. Document list
deactivate P
S -->> C : 9. Document list
deactivate S
C -->> UI : 10. Return result or error
end
deactivate C
UI -->> U : 11. Show result or error
deactivate UI
U -> UI : 12. Delete selected document
activate UI
